OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie bombing trial postponed
OL,4,Adays before it was due to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FAl-Marimi has denied building the bomb
OL,7,Fthat destroyed Pan Am Flight 103 on 21
OL,8,FDecember 1988, killing 270 people.
